    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF10: Staff Onboarding and Social Media Automation\n\n### Staff Onboarding Drip Campaign (WF10A)\n**Trigger:** Webhook for new staff registration\n**Flow:**\n1. Welcome Email (Day 0) - Immediate welcome with company info\n2. Wait 3 Days\n3. Training Email (Day 3) - Training materials and resources\n4. Wait 7 Days  \n5. Follow-up Email (Day 10) - Check-in and support offer\n6. Log to Staff Database - Track onboarding progress\n\n**Required Data:**\n- staffName, staffEmail, department, startDate\n\n### Social Media Pet Tip Automation (WF10B)\n**Trigger:** Weekly schedule (Tuesdays at 9 AM)\n**Flow:**\n1. Generate AI Pet Tip - OpenAI creates educational content\n2. Format Social Media Post - Structure for platforms\n3. Post to Facebook & Twitter/X - Multi-platform posting\n4. Log Social Media Activity - Track posts in sheets\n\n**Features:**\n- AI-generated veterinary tips\n- Professional formatting with clinic branding\n- Automatic hashtag generation\n- Cross-platform posting\n- Complete activity logging\n\n**Placeholders Used:**\n{{CLINIC_NAME}}, {{VETERINARIAN_NAME}}, {{MANAGER_NAME}}, {{BUSINESS_COLOR}}, {{CLINIC_ADDRESS}}, {{BUSINESS_PHONE}}, {{BUSINESS_WEBSITE}}, {{SERVICES_OFFERED}}, {{CANCELLATION_POLICY}}, {{EMERGENCY_CONTACT}}, {{SUPPORT_EMAIL}}, {{FROM_EMAIL}}, {{STAFF_SHEET_ID}}, {{SOCIAL_MEDIA_SHEET_ID}}, {{FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID}}, {{SENDGRID_CREDENTIAL_ID}}, {{GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL_ID}}, {{OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID}}, {{FACEBOOK_CREDENTIAL_ID}}, {{TWITTER_CREDENTIAL_ID}}",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 400
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1160,
        20
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "fe670b1e-2bdb-498a-b477-8f4187b24628",
      "name": "Workflow Documentation"
    }
